graph LR
    TO[trainer-operator]

    %% Go libraries
    TO -->|operator runtime| CR["controller-runtime v0.25.2"]
    TO -->|clients, types| K8sLibs["client-go / apimachinery v0.37.1"]
    TO -->|API types, TLSOptions| KFTrainerLib["kubeflow/trainer/v2 v2.3.0"]
    TO -->|cluster detect, OLM, GC, render| PU["odh-platform-utilities v0.5.0"]
    TO -->|reconciler, deploy, TLS loader| PUF["odh-platform-utilities/framework v0.3.1"]
    TO -->|TLS profile types| OSAPI[openshift/api]
    TO -->|cipher name tables| OSLib[openshift/library-go]
    TO -->|HTTP/2 NextProtos| OSCRC[openshift/controller-runtime-common]
    TO -->|OperatorVersion| OFAPI["operator-framework/api v0.42.0"]
    TO -->|version parsing| Semver["blang/semver v4"]

    %% Hard runtime prerequisites
    TO -->|gates reconcile| JobSetCRD["JobSet CRD<br/>jobset.x-k8s.io v1alpha2"]
    TO -->|health check, OpenShift| JobSetOp["Red Hat JobSet Operator<br/>JobSetOperator cluster"]
    TO -->|detect jobset-operator| OLM["OLM operatorconditions /<br/>clusterextensions"]
    TO -->|ServiceMonitor, PrometheusRule| PromOp["Prometheus Operator CRDs"]
    TO -->|metrics cert| ServiceCA["OpenShift service-ca"]
    TO -->|TLS profile| OSConfig["config.openshift.io APIServer"]
    TO -->|REST + watch 6443| K8sAPI[Kubernetes API]
    TO -->|training-hub ImageStreams| IS["OpenShift Image Streams"]

    %% Internal platform
    RHODS[rhods-operator] -->|creates Trainer CR, env, odh-trainer-config| TO
    TO -->|deploys and configures| KFT["Kubeflow Trainer controller<br/>operand v2.3.0"]
    KFTRepo["opendatahub-io/trainer<br/>manifests + image"] -.->|manifest sync workflow| TO
    TO -->|image refs| THImages["training-hub / odh-th-torch,<br/>speculator, vllm images"]
    TO -->|monitoring| RHOAIMon["RHOAI monitoring"]

    %% Operand consumers
    Users["Dashboard / Kubeflow SDK / users"] -->|TrainJobs| KFT
    KFT -->|creates| JobSetCRD

